---
import PrimaryButton from '../ui/PrimaryButton.astro';
---

<section data-wf-component-id="b1a66fc8-9575-590c-585f-0cc5c6187fc6" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section white">
        <div class="section-gap large">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="section-header-left">
                <div class="text-stack">
                  <div class="section-badge">
                    <div class="section-badge-mark"></div>
                    <p class="font-label">FAQ</p>
                  </div>
                  <h2 class="font-h2 style-font">Question &amp; answer</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="section-header-right">
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-button-wrap">
                  <PrimaryButton href="/contact-us" variant="black">Get in touch</PrimaryButton>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-v3-grid">
              <div class="faq-v2-list">
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card-v3">
                  <div class="faq-v2-head">
                    <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                      <div class="faq-number">[1]</div>
                      <p class="faq-title-v3">What makes our interior design agency stand out from the rest?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M4 12H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">One team from the first sketch to the last handle, so architecture and interiors are resolved together.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card-v3">
                  <div class="faq-v2-head">
                    <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                      <div class="faq-number">[2]</div>
                      <p class="faq-title-v3">Can I submit unlimited interior design requests?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M4 12H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Yes. Send as many as you like; we work through the queue in your order, one request active at a time.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card-v3">
                  <div class="faq-v2-head">
                    <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                      <div class="faq-number">[3]</div>
                      <p class="faq-title-v3">What if I only need interior design help for one project?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M4 12H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">That is fine. Single projects are quoted on their own scope, with a fixed fee and a clear end date set.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card-v3">
                  <div class="faq-v2-head">
                    <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                      <div class="faq-number">[4]</div>
                      <p class="faq-title-v3">Can I really request unlimited interior design services?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M4 12H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Yes. There is no monthly cap on requests, we simply keep one in progress so each gets full attention.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card-v3">
                  <div class="faq-v2-head">
                    <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                      <div class="faq-number">[5]</div>
                      <p class="faq-title-v3">How quickly will I get my interior design concepts?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M4 12H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">First concepts within five working days of sign-off, revisions back in two, and you see every stage.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card-v3">
                  <div class="faq-v2-head">
                    <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                      <div class="faq-number">[6]</div>
                      <p class="faq-title-v3">Are there any limits to the number of interior design requests I can make?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M4 12H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">No cap on the total. Your plan sets how many run at once, and you can reorder the queue at any time.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-right"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Image-Design-yours.webp" alt="Modern two-story white house with large black-framed windows illuminating interior spaces, including a living and dining area, a children's room with a teepee, and a dark entrance door, set against a clear sky and a tiled driveway." sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Image-Design-yours-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Image-Design-yours-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Image-Design-yours-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Image-Design-yours.webp 1368w" class="faq-image" /></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
